":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":43409408,"digest":"sha256:1c547150fcdb271aa88796ee4bd87e00ed17d91482e49599dd4a02f52ec8def2","download_count":122,"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:12:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:12:58Z"},{"id":680675275,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4okkfL","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":48455402,"digest":"sha256:5d393558cc748bcf3bfde4e2a93d630fb4d5525ae79871c8b36fa350fbf590ec","download_count":189,"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:25:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:25:12Z"},{"id":680706993,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oksOx","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":12050,"digest":"sha256:5d9f171276aad6ef0b2f1dfea28bfedf4bbb35483d0ada8a6debeaff14dda262","download_count":23207,"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:30Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- RabbitMQ 发送面板新增消息属性区，支持 content_type、delivery_mode、priority、TTL、时间戳等字段，并可在消息列表中查看与复制 (contributed by @lcq928) (PR [#13553](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13553))\n- Spanner 的索引与主键保留列的升降序方向，DDL 查看和索引面板不再丢失 `DESC` (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13550](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13550))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 连接后自动展开对象树恢复为默认开启，与 v0.6.55 及更早版本行为一致\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复 v0.6.56 中首次点击数据库连接只连接、不展开子节点的问题，Redis、MongoDB、MQTT 等各类连接均受影响\n- 修复「连接后自动展开对象树」设置无法保存、开关不生效的问题 (contributed by @Gaiokane) (PR [#13574](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13574))\n- 修复 PostgreSQL 的 `FETCH` 语句不返回游标结果、只显示空结果集的问题 (contributed by @heeeex100) (PR [#13556](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13556))\n- 修复选中超长数值单元格时结果面板底部按钮被挤出、无法加载全部和导出的问题 (contributed by @jeff377) (PR [#13578](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13578))\n- 修复 SQL 格式化设置中的下拉框使用原生样式、与其他设置项不一致的问题 (contributed by @Ezreal-byte) (PR [#13548](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13548))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.58) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.58` 拉取。\n","mentions_count":6}
